---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Stepan Sazonov
description: Free browser tools that run on your device. Nothing is uploaded.
lang: en
section: home
permalink: /
translationUrl: /ru/
englishUrl: /
---
<section class="home-intro">
  <div class="hero-mark{% if branding.logo %} has-logo{% endif %}" aria-hidden="true">{% if branding.logo %}{{ branding.logo | safe }}{% else %}S{% endif %}</div>
  <h1>Stepan Sazonov</h1>
  <p class="lede">I make small browser tools and give them away.</p>
</section>

<section class="index-section" aria-labelledby="tools-title">
  <h2 class="section-label" id="tools-title">Tools</h2>
  <ul class="index-list">
    {% for tool in tools %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ tool.url }}">{{ tool.name }}</a>
        <span class="status">{{ tool.status }}</span>
        <p class="description">{{ tool.description.en }}</p>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
